 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nHarborline Foods Corp                                      MASTER SERVICES\n742 Evergreen Terrace, 80201 Denver, United States                  AGREEMENT\nVAT No: US32-6052701\nReg No: US-136516\n\nFROM                                                     BILL TO\n\nHarborline Foods Corp                                    Northwind Trading Inc\n742 Evergreen Terrace                                    1200 Industrial Parkway\n80201 Denver                                             80201 Denver\nUnited States                                            United States\nVAT: US32-6052701\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 03/21/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Harborline Foods Corp, with its registered office at 742 Evergreen Terrace,\nDenver (\"Party A\"), and Northwind Trading Inc, with its registered office at 1200 Industrial Parkway,\nDenver (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A   Harborline Foods Corp / John Carter\nParty B   Northwind Trading Inc / David Kim\nDate      03/21/2026",
